  "content": "<h1 align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我们的Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\">\n  </a>\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n# 砍树小助手\n\n一个Minecraft数据包，当你蹲下并破坏原木时，可以自动砍倒整棵树。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wEhW4ceB/images/32390c308957b4fd88e0a12083649cd56b1ce576.gif\" alt=\"砍树小助手预览\">\n</p>\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- 砍树功能仅在蹲下（潜行）时激活\n- 如果只想破坏一个方块，请保持正常站立状态（不蹲下）破坏原木\n- 树叶会像手动破坏一样掉落正常的物品（树苗、木棍）\n- 每次使用后会有短暂的冷却时间，以防性能问题",
